WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.970
Most of us fell in love with working inside Claude and its interface.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.330
Very happy together.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.750
Except real work happens mostly with others, and often in the Google Suite.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.210
That's because your team works in the file.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:21.810
It's like doing a puzzle in the corner, while your colleagues work on the real one at the table.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.850
But now Claude comes to that table too.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:32.110
Claude for Google Workspace opens next to your file, reads it and edits it right there.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:39.750
Which makes it much easier to work and collaborate: you, your peers and Claude, all on the same surface.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:47.790
So in this adventure, you learn to get the most out of this new release, on real work in a Sheet, a Doc and a deck.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:55.150
And you identify which scenarios are better done directly in the Google ecosystem, with Claude as a companion.
